  "local_mass_first_rule": "allocate local material preferentially to high-mass structure, shielding, conductors, thermal mass, glass/ceramics and simple mechanical components; allocate scarce carried concentrates to low-mass/high-function voxels until local purity and synthesis routes close the gap",
